### PREAMBLE

This License Agreement ("Agreement") governs the download, installation, execution, evaluation, and integration of the InBoost AI Proxy, InBoost Runtime, and accompanying binary components ("Software") provided by InBoost Technologies ("InBoost").

InBoost provides an accessible, non-revocable Community License for individual developers, researchers, evaluators, and organizations, coupled with an automatic, zero-friction elevation to a commercial InBoost Pro License upon the placement or discovery of an authorized cryptographic license file.

BY DOWNLOADING, INSTALLING, RUNNING, OR USING THE SOFTWARE, YOU AGREE TO BE BOUND BY ALL TERMS, CONDITIONS, RESTRICTIONS, AND DISCLAIMERS SET FORTH IN THIS AGREEMENT (INCLUDING INBOOST'S EXCLUSIVE RIGHT UNDER SECTION 11 TO ELECT THE DISPUTE RESOLUTION FORUM, AND THE WAIVER OF CLASS ACTIONS). IF YOU DO NOT AGREE TO THESE TERMS IN THEIR ENTIRETY, YOU ARE NOT LICENSED TO USE THE SOFTWARE AND YOU MUST CEASE ALL USE IMMEDIATELY.

